Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A contractor sends drawings.\NWhat will the fittings cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They need that answer early.\NThe quote is how Ahlsell wins the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The customer wants a clear request.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The specialist must sign off\Non the take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Today that answer is hand work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing after drawing.\NThey start from a blank page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hours. Miss a room, the quote is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the first pass was not blank?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:01:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,AI drafts the markup.\NThe specialist does not start from zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They check. They verify.\NThey add or remove what is needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They sign off on the take-off.\NThe draft does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster. More confident.\NStill a person accountable.
